From dd06be70d9b01ac392c79838d18a01b2789e917f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WeiguangTWK <weiguangtwk@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 17:01:36 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Neko LineageOS: [ASTER] make NDK bindings available to the
 ASTER APEX

Allow the platform integrity APEX to use the generated Keystore2 NDK
library for hardware-backed source credential operations.

P.S. Existing AIDL interfaces and runtime authorizations are unchanged.

Change-Id: I371e29fcb93d4c427542ca2c339a4e37739b5c75
---
 keystore2/aidl/Android.bp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/keystore2/aidl/Android.bp b/keystore2/aidl/Android.bp
index da345d7..5a1c94d 100644
--- a/keystore2/aidl/Android.bp
+++ b/keystore2/aidl/Android.bp
@@ -32,6 +32,7 @@ aidl_interface {
             apex_available: [
                 "//apex_available:platform",
                 "com.android.wifi",
+                "com.android.platform.integrity",
             ],
         },
         rust: {
-- 
2.43.0

